+# Design: authored Markdown knowledge bundles
+
+## Goal
+
+Convert authored Markdown documents into deterministic `KnowledgeBundle` values accepted by the existing bundle import. Preserve heading context, prose, tables, collection scoped document identities, glossary input, and only valid colloquial section references.
+
+## Scope
+
+Add the framework free module `pharma_agent.domain.corpus.authoring` with Markdown splitting, ASCII Vietnamese aware slugging, section keys, reading order choices, and bundle construction. Use the existing corpus bundle record types and import validation. Keep bundle serialization, import behavior, chunking, APIs, and existing source ingestion unchanged.
+
+## Interfaces
+
+- `split_markdown(markdown: str, *, fallback_heading: str) -> list[AuthoredSection]`; each section has `heading: str`, `path: tuple[str, ...]`, `ordinal: int`, and `blocks: list[BlockRecord]`.
+- `slugify(text: str, *, max_length: int = 80) -> str`.
+- `section_key(document_key: str, path: Sequence[str]) -> str`.
+- `section_choices(collection: BundleCollection, documents: Sequence[AuthoredDocument]) -> list[tuple[str, str]]` (collection used to scope document keys; document values include key, title, markdown and fallback heading).
+- `build_bundle(collection: BundleCollection, documents: Sequence[AuthoredDocument], glossary: Sequence[GlossaryEntry], colloquial: Sequence[ColloquialMappingRecord]) -> KnowledgeBundle`.
+
+Authored document input is a small immutable value with `key`, `title`, `markdown`, and `fallback_heading`. Bundle document keys are `<collection.key>:<document.key>`. Section records use the bundle document key and section keys derived from its path. Manifest counts reflect emitted documents and nonempty sections.
+
+## Approach
+
+Implement in `domain/corpus/authoring.py`, adjacent to `bundle.py`. Parse Markdown line by line, tracking fenced code delimiters so heading and table detection ignores fenced contents. Maintain a heading stack for ATX headings; each emitted heading section has a path including its heading, while preamble content uses the fallback heading and empty path. Consecutive table lines form one table block, numbered across the document; other content is stripped into prose blocks. Discard empty sections.
+
+Slugify through Unicode decomposition and explicit Vietnamese `đ` transliteration, then retain lowercase ASCII alphanumeric words separated by hyphens and enforce the maximum length without a trailing separator. Build stable records in input document order and sort bundle documents by key; section records follow document reading order. Use stable generator metadata, empty source digests and files, and exact input glossary order. Filter mapping section references against emitted section keys and omit mappings with no remaining references.
+
+## Testing
+
+Add focused unit tests in `backend/tests/domain/corpus/test_authoring.py` for fenced headings, nested headings and preamble, empty sections, prose/table grouping, Vietnamese slugging and truncation, collection scoped keys, reading order labels, mapping cleanup, manifest counts, and deterministic bundle digests. Run each task's focused test before implementation, then run the full backend suite with `uv run pytest` from `backend/`.
